  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Rewards decorations</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/00/Shop_Rewards.png/revision/latest?cb=20171021181302\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Rewards tab\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rewards tab\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Rewards tab</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Reward decorations</b> are gifts from <a href=\"/wiki/supercell-3601\" title=\"Supercell\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Supercell</a> to players. They are unique and are all delivered by <a href=\"/wiki/alfred-4276\" title=\"Alfred\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Alfred</a> with a special thank-you note.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<p><b><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Experience</a> Level Rewards</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGolden_Greg_Statue.png\" title=\"Golden Greg Statue.png (274 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/74/Golden_Greg_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20190625055704\" title=\"Golden Greg Statue.png (274 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Golden Greg Statue(lvl 50)\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Golden Greg Statue.png (274 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Golden Greg Statue(lvl 50)\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Golden Greg Statue(lvl 50)</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGolden_Tree.png\" title=\"Golden Tree.png (301 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/8b/Golden_Tree.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150912152506\" title=\"Golden Tree.png (301 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Golden Tree (lvl 100)\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Golden Tree.png (301 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Golden Tree (lvl 100)\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Golden Tree (lvl 100)</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGolden_Duck_Fountain.png\" title=\"Golden Duck Fountain.png (231 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/25/Golden_Duck_Fountain.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20190630155720\" title=\"Golden Duck Fountain.png (231 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Golden Duck Fountain (lvl 150)\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Golden Duck Fountain.png (231 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Golden Duck Fountain (lvl 150)\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Golden Duck Fountain (lvl 150)</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3APrized_Pig_Painting_Statue.png\" title=\"Prized Pig Painting Statue.png (297 KB)\" re